# mongodump archives. These are FULL production snapshots — every user record,
# every email — so they must never reach the repository. Kept out of git rather
# than out of the working tree because taking one before a production write is
# the documented practice (docs/DATABASE_BACKUP_RESTORE.md).
/backups
